WEBVTT

00:07:01.387 --> 00:07:04.494
So this is the big idea.

00:07:04.518 --> 00:07:07.059
It's a giant airbag.

00:07:07.083 --> 00:07:10.714
The expansion takes
the shape of its container

00:07:10.738 --> 00:07:12.453
and it oozes out wherever it can --

00:07:12.477 --> 00:07:14.476
the top and sides.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.226
But more poetically,

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.268
we like to think of the structure

00:07:18.292 --> 00:07:20.340
as inhaling the democratic
air of the Mall,

00:07:20.364 --> 00:07:24.101
bringing it into itself.

00:07:24.125 --> 00:07:28.072
The before and the after.

00:07:28.096 --> 00:07:31.226
It was dubbed "the bubble" by the press.